 Hello from Little Rock, Arkansas. Love an airport that's near downtown.

 I'm headed to Davos in January for Axios House. Details here . Are you going? Is this the perfect excuse to buy more Arc'teryx? 🤠 Situational awareness: Cowboy Space, founded by Robinhood co-founder Baiju Bhatt , unveiled its "Big Iron" rocket last night. Its upper stage is designed to stay in orbit.

 My boy Thomas Novelly has more, here . Further afield: North Korea's field notes, Warhound's valuation and Denmark's missile spree.

 Today's newsletter is 1,582 words, a 6-minute read. 

 
 
